<title>JAPAN: Mexico launches 100 bln yen 3.1% samurai--Nikko.</title>
<headline>Mexico launches 100 bln yen 3.1% samurai--Nikko.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following samurai issue was announced by lead manager Nikko Securities on Tuesday:</p>
<p> BORROWER	  Mexico</p>
<p> AMT		 100 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON	    3.10 pct</p>
<p> MATURITY	  24 April 2002</p>
<p> ISS PRICE	 99.90</p>
<p> PAY DATE	  24 April 1997</p>
<p> SUB PERIOD	April 16 to April 18</p>
<p> PAY FREQ	  Semi-annual</p>
<p> LAST RATING     S&amp;P BB, Moody's Ba2</p>
<p> LEAD MANAGER    Nikko Securities</p>
<p> LEAD TRUSTEE    N/A</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-3432-8785</p>
</text>
